{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-settings-ui#card-zh","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-settings-ui","commit":"c6319030acecdcb58e188e394afc2d633f5151dd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-settings-ui 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的界面插件，在原生设置窗口中加入“设置界面”面板，并通过客户端样式调整该窗口。用户可以选择预设、全屏或自定义尺寸，设置背景不透明度和亮暗主题各自的纯色背景；改动可即时预览，并通过宿主设置服务保存到 profile。它适合希望调整设置窗口大小、透明效果或配色的 Web UI 用户。安装使用 dsh plugin add 命令；无需额外账号或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/bundle.js:225-284","client/bundle.js:121-153","src/index.mjs:292-323"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-settings-ui#card-en","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-settings-ui","commit":"c6319030acecdcb58e188e394afc2d633f5151dd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-settings-ui customizes the DSH Web settings window. Choose preset, fullscreen, or custom dimensions, adjust opacity, and set light and dark background colors. Changes apply immediately and save to the DSH profile through the host settings service. No account or API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client/bundle.js:225-284","client/bundle.js:121-153","src/index.mjs:292-323"]}
